# Development environment for local API + Expo debugging.
# Left blank on purpose: a hardcoded LAN IP here goes stale every time this
# machine's network changes (DHCP lease, different Wi-Fi, container restart),
# breaking every fetch with no obvious cause. apiClient.ts's
# getAutoApiBaseUrl() already derives the right host from Expo's own
# hostUri — the same address the phone just used to load the JS bundle, so
# it's guaranteed reachable. Only set this if you need to point at a
# non-default backend (e.g. a remote/staging API).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
